{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54034","headline":"功勳五位颂（原注：本则既已出上。异本作「上堂次示问话僧颂」） 三 · 良价","name":"功勳五位颂（原注：本则既已出上。异本作「上堂次示问话僧颂」） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枯木花开劫外春，倒骑玉象乘（《五灯会元》作「趁」）麒麟。\n而今高隐千峰外，月皎风清好日辰。\n（功）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54034.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54034","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}